{"seq":1,"slug":"the-socratic-problem","title":"The Socratic Problem","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/controversies-and-appraisal/the-socratic-problem","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-historical-socrates","title":"历史的苏格拉底","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/controversies-and-appraisal/the-socratic-problem/the-historical-socrates","wordCount":2071,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"sources-in-tension","title":"史料的张力","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/controversies-and-appraisal/the-socratic-problem/sources-in-tension","wordCount":1987,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章审视评价苏格拉底的根本难题——\"苏格拉底问题\"。由于苏格拉底不著一字，历史上真实的苏格拉底难以确切还原；柏拉图、色诺芬、阿里斯托芬等史料之间，存在着明显的张力。本章辨析这些史料的差异，主张以审慎而批判的态度，在张力中趋近真实的苏格拉底。\n"}